{"news": {"id": 1301891, "note": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;Dear all,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;The agenda of group presentation has been updated into the following form.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;Please check if your name is on the form, as well as the presentation date and order of your group.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jR_C04L1G4ZVVtwOXtYfvKtgaNNu6wk6ANhrCa36P3I/edit?usp=sharing\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 255); text-decoration-line: none; font-family: arial; letter-spacing: normal;\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1jR_C04L1G4ZVVtwOXtYfvKtgaNNu6wk6ANhrCa36P3I/edit?usp=sharing</a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;About the presentation</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\u5fae\u8edf\u6b63\u9ed1\u9ad4&quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial\">\uff1a</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. Please prepare<span style=\"color:red\">&nbsp;</span>a&nbsp;<span style=\"color:red\">10 minutes</span>&nbsp;(+/- 1 min) presentation.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; Groups that can deliver their presentation closer to 10 minutes will get bonus points.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;E.g. those who can complete it for10 min and 10 sec may be awarded more points than those who do it&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; for 9 min and10 sec.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&q